{
  "id": "section-arcane-skills",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0000",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Arcane Skills\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[15,557,571]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0001",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "You cannot learn Arcane Skills at\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[15,571,605]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0002",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "the beginning of play, but only\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[15,605,637]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0003",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "when certain conditions apply,\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[15,637,668]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0004",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "such as reading specific occult\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[15,668,700]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0005",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "books (an activity that uses d3\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[15,700,732]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0006",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "“boxes” of time) AND spending a\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[15,732,764]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0007",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "number of XP to learn the Arcane\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[15,764,797]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0008",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Skill. Some Arcane Skills may be\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[15,797,830]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0009",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "learned twice (they have an Expert\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[15,830,865]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0010",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "level).\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[15,865,873]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0011",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Some require certain tools. These\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[15,873,907]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0012",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "are listed under components. You\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[15,907,940]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0013",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "must find these tools during your\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[15,940,974]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0014",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "adventure.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[15,974,985]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0015",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Some may be cast only by spending\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[15,985,1019]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0016",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "certain materials. These are listed\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[15,1019,1055]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0017",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "under Sacrifices. At the end of the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[15,1055,1091]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0018",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Arcane Skill use, sacrificed\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[15,1091,1120]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0019",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "materials are lost, even if the roll\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[15,1120,1157]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0020",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "fails.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[15,1157,1164]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0021",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Alien Fighter (3 XP)\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[15,1164,1185]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0022",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "You may learn this Arcane Skill by\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[15,1185,1220]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0023",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "reading the book They Are Among\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[15,1220,1252]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0024",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Us. You gain +1 to Attack and\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[15,1252,1282]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0025",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Defense rolls against Aliens.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[15,1282,1312]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0026",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Expert: the bonus becomes +2.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[15,1312,1342]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0027",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Curse (2 XP)\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[15,1342,1355]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0028",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Components: lighter or box of\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[15,1355,1385]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0029",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "matches.",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[15,1385,1393]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0030",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Sacrifice: 1 candle, 1 dose of bone\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[16,22,58]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0031",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "powder.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[16,58,66]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0032",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "You may learn this ritual from one\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[16,66,101]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0033",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "of the following books:\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[16,101,125]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0034",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "● The Necronomicon\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[16,125,144]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0035",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "● The Diabolical Deal\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[16,144,166]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0036",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "You can perform this ritual to\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[16,166,197]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0037",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "prepare a curse that you will “cast”\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[16,197,234]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0038",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "in combat later. The target of the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[16,234,269]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0039",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "curse must be decided at the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[16,269,298]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0040",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "moment of performing the ritual.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[16,298,331]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0041",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "It may be a specific creature with\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[16,331,366]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0042",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "a given name, or a generic\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[16,366,393]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0043",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "category like “zombie”.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[16,393,417]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0044",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "The effect of a “generic” curse is to\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[16,417,455]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0045",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "reduce the target’s L by 1 for the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[16,455,490]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0046",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "duration of a whole encounter. A\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[16,490,523]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0047",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "specific curse reduces the target’s\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[16,523,559]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0048",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "L by 2 for the duration of a whole\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[16,559,594]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0049",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "encounter.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[16,594,605]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0050",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "“Firing” the curse happens at will\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[16,605,640]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0051",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "in combat and it does not require\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[16,640,674]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0052",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "the expenditure of an action.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[16,674,704]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0053",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Example: You cast the curse\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[16,704,732]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0054",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "against zombies. The first\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[16,732,759]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0055",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "time you meet zombies after\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[16,759,787]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0056",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "performing the ritual, those\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[16,787,816]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0057",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "zombies will be L2 instead of\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[16,816,846]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0058",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "L3.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[16,846,850]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0059",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Example 2: You perform the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[16,850,877]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0060",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "curse ritual against the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[16,877,902]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0061",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Polka-Dot Maniac, a known\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[16,902,928]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0062",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "slasher. When you meet him,\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[16,928,956]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0063",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "his L will be reduced by 2.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[16,956,984]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0064",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "You may have only one curse\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[16,984,1012]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0065",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "going on at any given time. You\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[16,1012,1044]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0066",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "may decide not to fire it when you\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[16,1044,1079]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0067",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "encounter the cursed creature and\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[16,1079,1113]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0068",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "keep it for later. Once the curse\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[16,1113,1147]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0069",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "has been used, you may perform\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[16,1147,1178]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0070",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "the curse ritual again, using\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[16,1178,1208]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0071",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "another candle and another dose\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[16,1208,1240]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0072",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "of bone powder.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[16,1240,1256]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0073",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Demon Slayer (3 XP)\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[16,1256,1276]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0074",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "You have +1 to saves and Defense\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[16,1276,1309]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0075",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "rolls vs. any creature from the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[16,1309,1341]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0076",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Demonic Horrors table.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[16,1341,1364]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0077",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Expert: the bonus becomes +2.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[16,1364,1394]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0078",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Energy of the Macrocosmos (3 XP)\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[16,1394,1427]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0079",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Components: incense\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[16,1427,1447]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0080",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Sacrifice: 1 candle or 2 Food\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[16,1447,1477]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0081",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "To learn this ritual, you must have\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[16,1477,1513]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0082",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "the Occultist Skill at basic or expert\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[16,1513,1552]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0083",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "level and read one of the following\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[16,1552,1588]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0084",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "books:\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[16,1588,1595]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0085",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "● Necronomicon\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[16,1595,1610]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0086",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "● Occult Guide\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[16,1610,1625]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0087",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Performing the ritual takes 2\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[16,1625,1655]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0088",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "boxes of time. At the end of the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[16,1655,1688]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0089",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "ritual, you gain d6 Luck points.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[16,1688,1721]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0090",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "During the game, you may expend\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[16,1721,1753]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0091",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "1 Luck point to avoid 1 damage or",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[16,1753,1786]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0092",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "gain +1 on an Attack or Defense\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[17,22,54]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0093",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "roll. You may not apply more than\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[17,54,88]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0094",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "1 Luck point at a time. You may\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[17,88,120]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0095",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "perform this ritual only once per\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[17,120,154]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0096",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "mission.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[17,154,163]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0097",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Exorcism (2 XP)\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[17,163,179]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0098",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Components: 1  of the following:\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[17,179,212]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0099",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "● Holy water\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[17,212,225]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0100",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "● Incense\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[17,225,235]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0101",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "● Essential oils\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[17,235,252]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0102",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "You may learn this Arcane Skill\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[17,252,284]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0103",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "from one of the following books:\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[17,284,317]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0104",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "● Holy Book\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[17,317,329]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0105",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "● The Occult Guide\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[17,329,348]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0106",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "● The Diabolical Deal\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[17,348,370]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0107",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "You may expel a demon or spirit\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[17,370,402]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0108",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "from a possessed item, locale,\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[17,402,433]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0109",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "animal or person. Doing so\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[17,433,460]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0110",
      "kind": "body",
