    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0219",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "roll at +1 if you have Will, +2 if you\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[19,292,331]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0220",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "have Will (Expert) against the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[19,331,362]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0221",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "creature’s L. If you fail the roll, the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[19,362,402]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0222",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "creature will attack you! You must\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[19,402,437]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0223",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "fight a creature with its L, as many\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[19,437,474]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0224",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Life points as its L and damage 1.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[19,474,509]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0225",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "You may not Escape from this\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[19,509,538]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0226",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "fight.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[19,538,545]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0227",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Once you control the Servitor, it\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[19,545,579]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0228",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "will move with you. It can become\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[19,579,613]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0229",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "invisible at will, so its presence will\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[19,613,653]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0230",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "not affect your interactions with\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[19,653,687]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0231",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "people or your Charisma rolls.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[19,687,718]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0232",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "You can use it to fight as if it were\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[19,718,756]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0233",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "another character. It will have a\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[19,756,790]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0234",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "bonus to Attack and Defense rolls\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[19,790,824]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0235",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "equal to half its L, and a number\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[19,824,858]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0236",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "of Life points equal to its L. The\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[19,858,893]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0237",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "creature will always fight in your\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[19,893,928]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0238",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "place until it reaches 0 Life and\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[19,928,962]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0239",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "disappears. When you encounter\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[19,962,993]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0240",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "multiple foes, you must split their\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[19,993,1029]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0241",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "attacks as equally as possible\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[19,1029,1060]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0242",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "between yourself and the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[19,1060,1085]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0243",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Servitor.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[19,1085,1095]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0244",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "You may attempt to summon\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[19,1095,1121]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0245",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "another servitor, repeating the\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[19,1121,1153]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0246",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "same procedure described above,\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[19,1153,1185]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0247",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "only when the previous one dies.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[19,1185,1218]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0248",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "You may not have two servitors at\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[19,1218,1252]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0249",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "the same time.  You may at any\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[19,1252,1283]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0250",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "moment dismiss a controlled\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[19,1283,1311]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0251",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Servitor. It will just disappear if you\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[19,1311,1351]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0252",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "so wish.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[19,1351,1360]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-arcane-skills:p0253",
